  "question": {
    "text": "A particle is moving with a uniform speed in a circular orbit of radius R in a central force inversely proportional to the <math><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> power of R. If the period of rotation of the particle is T, then:",
